@startuml
!include theme.iuml
title Reference lookup: separate sources, explicit draft handoff
hide footbox
autonumber
actor User
participant "Dictionary\n<<React function>>" as Web
participant "App\n<<React function>>" as Shell
participant "main.get_dictionary\n<<route function>>" as API
participant "dictionary\n<<function module>>" as Reference
participant "Versioned Markdown files" as Files

activate User
User -> Web : Open dictionary / change search or page
activate Web
note over Web : Debounce 250 ms; cancel stale requests.\nDo not load the dictionary while its page is hidden.
Web -> API : GET /api/dictionary?query&offset&limit
activate API
API -> Reference : list_dictionary(query, offset, limit)
activate Reference
Reference -> Reference : load_dictionary()
activate Reference
loop Each supplied file, until complete or read/validation failure
  Reference -> Files : read_text(UTF-8)
  activate Files
  Files --> Reference : Markdown or read error
  deactivate Files
  opt Read succeeded
    Reference -> Reference : parse_dictionary(text, filename)
    activate Reference
    Reference --> Reference : Entries / validation error
    deactivate Reference
  end
end
Reference --> Reference : All entries / safe CollectionError
deactivate Reference
note over Reference : Successful loads preserve every source row and sense.\nSearch normalized words, forms and meanings; slice one page.\nNo dataset read, approval, fieldwork count or provider call.
Reference --> API : DictionaryResponse / safe 503
deactivate Reference
API --> Web : 200 paginated entries / 422 or 503
deactivate API
Web --> User : Meanings + source file/line / retryable error
deactivate Web
opt User chooses a reference entry
  User -> Web : Open in translator
  activate Web
  Web -> Shell : onTranslate(listed form)
  activate Shell
  note over Shell : Fill a new draft; direction Francanglais to English.\nTranslator enables reference lookup on handoff.\nNo submit or save.
  Shell --> Web : Translation draft state
  deactivate Shell
  Web --> User : Editable draft; explicit Translate still required
  deactivate Web
end
deactivate User
@enduml
